<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0679_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kay &amp; Tia</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You had fun scrappin’ us, right?\rSo how ’bout we swap phone\nnumbers, and that way if we wanna\fscrap again, we can just call\feach other? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, now you got our number\nand we got yours.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? But... Oh well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You decide you wanna swap\nnumbers after all? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, here you go!\nIt’s a Oval Stone.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nWait, ain’t you right nearby?\rYou just REALLY like talkin’ on the\nphone or somethin’? Weird hobby.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} WAY stronger now!\rWe was scrappin’ a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nrecently and it was over before we\fknew it!\rOh yeah, by the way, this Tia.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} WAY stronger now!\rWe was scrappin’ a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nrecently and it was over before we\fknew it!\rOh yeah, by the way, this Kay.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Earlier we saw a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} on\nRoute 15. Didn’t we, Tia?\rYeah, then outta nowhere a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\npopped out. Didn’t it, Kay?\rYeah, and we was so shook we just\nran. Didn’t we, Tia?\rI keep thinkin’ about it, Kay, and\nI think since we got homies,\fwe shoulda just scrapped, right?\rIs it hard to tell who’s who when\nyou on the phone with both of us?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We shoulda another scrap, just\nthe three of us.\rWe on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so c’mon\nover when you get the chance.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Didn’t we make plans to have\nanother scrap?\rWe waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so\ndon’t forget, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, since we on the phone, how\nabout we give you a quiz?\r...\rSo, who talkin’ right now? Kay or\nTia?\r...\n...\f...\f...\fThe correct answer is...\rEleanor from the Homie Fan Club,\nwho standin’ next to the twins!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, Tia found a Oval Stone.\rIt’s yours if you come find us\non {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Got it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nWe’ll give you a Oval Stone...</language>
	</row>
</body>
